      "caption": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "Incantation in praise of Midra, Lord of Frenzied Flame.\n\nSummons an apparition of the Lord's head to spew frenzied flame.\nThis incantation can be used while in motion. The apparition will remain for as long as the input is held.\n\nThe Lord of Frenzied Flame shall take their torment, despair. Their affliction. Every sin, every curse. All melted away.\nYet Midra, like others before him, was too weak to become a Lord.",
